rgbt_rpc_calls_total{target="room",outcome="failed"} 11
rgbt_rpc_calls_total{target="room",outcome="ok"} 1079
# HELP rgbt_push_backfilled_frames 累计补发出去的推送帧数
# TYPE rgbt_push_backfilled_frames gauge
